    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter a dark and vague world, with danger lurking behind every corner and horrific foes withering under the scorched Sun. You play as a Tethered, one of many born from clay and dirt with a weapon bound to your soul, and you must adapt, salvage and strengthen your destructive powers to slay all that stands in your way. With strategic turn based combat and a free roam dungeon crawl experience, every decision you make will pave the path forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115480/extras/231f2c0464426f9b8b6367a20c9464dd.avif?t=1755035016\" width=616 height=152 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategic and deep turn based  combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powerful builds and gear combinations with a slot based inventory system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full 3D movement with turn based encounters, capturing the feel and depth of old school dungeon crawlers with modern  exploration </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cruel but beautiful world with environmental story telling</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115480/extras/b4a85b9b1b0c7777a0bf3f83dc50917c.avif?t=1755035016\" width=616 height=153 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Diviner, you are only as strong as your understanding of your tools. Wield powerful Tethers, ranging from flintlock pistols to greatswords, and imbue them with ancient magic and skills. Strengthen your weapons with the scraps of your defeated foe\u2019s tethers, and create powerful and customized builds tailored to your strategy.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter a dark and vague world, with danger lurking behind every corner and horrific foes withering under the scorched Sun. You play as a Tethered, one of many born from clay and dirt with a weapon bound to your soul, and you must adapt, salvage and strengthen your destructive powers to slay all that stands in your way. With strategic turn based combat and a free roam dungeon crawl experience, every decision you make will pave the path forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115480/extras/231f2c0464426f9b8b6367a20c9464dd.avif?t=1755035016\" width=616 height=152 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategic and deep turn based  combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powerful builds and gear combinations with a slot based inventory system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full 3D movement with turn based encounters, capturing the feel and depth of old school dungeon crawlers with modern  exploration </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cruel but beautiful world with environmental story telling</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115480/extras/b4a85b9b1b0c7777a0bf3f83dc50917c.avif?t=1755035016\" width=616 height=153 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Diviner, you are only as strong as your understanding of your tools. Wield powerful Tethers, ranging from flintlock pistols to greatswords, and imbue them with ancient magic and skills. Strengthen your weapons with the scraps of your defeated foe\u2019s tethers, and create powerful and customized builds tailored to your strategy.</p>",
    "short_description": "Enter a dark and vague world, filled with horrific foes withering under the Scorched Sun. You play as a Tethered, and you must salvage and strengthen your Tether to slay all that stands in your way, terrible as it may be. Every decision matters in this difficult dark fantasy dungeon crawler.",
